        // RAN: python .engine/tools/routing_probe.py --probe -> all 12 cases hold, all 8 rubric cases hold; --investigate release --samples 3 --turns 6 -> ROUTED release: 3/3 samples agree, prefix intake in every sample, spend 3.95 USD over 3 run(s), 87s wall (per run 1.3165 USD, 66.8s); gate validate 796 clean, check-engine clean, gate guard --no-receipt ALL PASS on c8df10d with the sprint and issue519 in the tree
